    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75879" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μά,</span></b> 
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὰ γάρ,</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μά</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μάν,</span></b> 
			<i>assuredly not</i>, prop. 
				Dor.
			, 
				Aeol.
			, etc. for 
				Ion.
			-
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μήν</span>, also used in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, who has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὰν οὐδέ</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ</span>
			 C. II, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μήν</span>.</div>
